				<description>&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a&#xD;&#xA;    href=&#34;https://code.visualstudio.com/api&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  &gt;官方API&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a&#xD;&#xA;    href=&#34;https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-extension-samples&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  &gt;官方案例&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a&#xD;&#xA;    href=&#34;https://rackar.github.io/vscode-ext-doccn/&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  &gt;中文翻译&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;项目管理&#34;&gt;项目管理&lt;a href=&#34;#%e9%a1%b9%e7%9b%ae%e7%ae%a1%e7%90%86&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;项目创建&#34;&gt;项目创建&lt;a href=&#34;#%e9%a1%b9%e7%9b%ae%e5%88%9b%e5%bb%ba&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&#xD;&#xA;  class=&#34;term-block my-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border shadow-sm&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  data-term-block&#xD;&#xA;  data-term-id=&#34;term-0&#34;&#xD;&#xA;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;term-header flex items-center justify-between border-b px-4 py-3&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;flex items-center gap-3&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;flex items-center gap-1.5&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#ff5f57]&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#febc2e]&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#28c840]&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;term-title text-sm font-medium&#34;&gt;Terminal&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;overflow-x-auto p-4&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;term-body font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;group relative pr-10&#34; data-term-group data-copy=&#34;npm install -g yo generator-code&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;button&#xD;&#xA;              class=&#34;term-copy-btn absolute top-0 right-0 z-10 flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium opacity-0 transition-all duration-200 ease-out group-hover:opacity-100 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#3fb950]/20 focus:outline-none&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              type=&#34;button&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              data-term-copy&#xD;&#xA;              data-label-copy=&#34;Copy&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              data-label-copied=&#34;Copied&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              title=&#34;Copy&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              aria-label=&#34;Copy&#34;&#xD;&#xA;            &gt;&#xD;&#xA;              &lt;span class=&#34;copy-icon&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;                &lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;path stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;              &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;              &lt;span class=&#34;copy-text hidden sm:inline&#34;&gt;Copy&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;/button&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&#34;whitespace-pre&#34;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;term-prompt font-semibold select-none&#34;&gt;$&lt;/span&#xD;&#xA;                    &gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pl-2&#34;&gt;npm install -g yo generator-code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;term-comment pl-2 italic select-none&#34;&gt;# 项目脚手架&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;          &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;group relative pr-10&#34; data-term-group data-copy=&#34;yo code&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;button&#xD;&#xA;              class=&#34;term-copy-btn absolute top-0 right-0 z-10 flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium opacity-0 transition-all duration-200 ease-out group-hover:opacity-100 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#3fb950]/20 focus:outline-none&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              type=&#34;button&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              data-term-copy&#xD;&#xA;              data-label-copy=&#34;Copy&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              data-label-copied=&#34;Copied&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              title=&#34;Copy&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              aria-label=&#34;Copy&#34;&#xD;&#xA;            &gt;&#xD;&#xA;              &lt;span class=&#34;copy-icon&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;                &lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;path stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;              &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;              &lt;span class=&#34;copy-text hidden sm:inline&#34;&gt;Copy&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;/button&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&#34;whitespace-pre&#34;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;term-prompt font-semibold select-none&#34;&gt;$&lt;/span&#xD;&#xA;                    &gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pl-2&#34;&gt;yo code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;term-comment pl-2 italic select-none&#34;&gt;# 配置项目&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;          &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;group relative pr-10&#34; data-term-group data-copy=&#34;tree -L 1&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;button&#xD;&#xA;              class=&#34;term-copy-btn absolute top-0 right-0 z-10 flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium opacity-0 transition-all duration-200 ease-out group-hover:opacity-100 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#3fb950]/20 focus:outline-none&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              type=&#34;button&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              data-term-copy&#xD;&#xA;              data-label-copy=&#34;Copy&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              data-label-copied=&#34;Copied&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              title=&#34;Copy&#34;&#xD;&#xA;              aria-label=&#34;Copy&#34;&#xD;&#xA;            &gt;&#xD;&#xA;              &lt;span class=&#34;copy-icon&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;                &lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;path stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;              &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;              &lt;span class=&#34;copy-text hidden sm:inline&#34;&gt;Copy&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;/button&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&#34;whitespace-pre&#34;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;term-prompt font-semibold select-none&#34;&gt;$&lt;/span&#xD;&#xA;                    &gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pl-2&#34;&gt;tree -L 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;          &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;term-output whitespace-pre&#34;&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;term-output whitespace-pre&#34;&gt;├── CHANGELOG.md&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;term-output whitespace-pre&#34;&gt;├── README.md&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;term-output whitespace-pre&#34;&gt;├── package Config.json&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;term-output whitespace-pre&#34;&gt;├── package-lock.json&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;term-output whitespace-pre&#34;&gt;├── package.json                    # 配置项目文件 &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;term-output whitespace-pre&#34;&gt;├── src&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;# 插件代码&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;term-output whitespace-pre&#34;&gt;├── tsconfig.json                   # ts 配置文件&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;term-output whitespace-pre&#34;&gt;└── vsc-extension-quickstart.md&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;项目配置&#34;&gt;项目配置&lt;a href=&#34;#%e9%a1%b9%e7%9b%ae%e9%85%8d%e7%bd%ae&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&#xD;&#xA;    class=&#34;alert alert-note my-6 overflow-hidden rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    style=&#34;background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-note) 10%, transparent);&#xD;&#xA;              border-left-color: var(--color-note);&#xD;&#xA;              --hover-bg: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-note) 15%, transparent);&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    onmouseover=&#34;this.style.backgroundColor = this.style.getPropertyValue(&#39;--hover-bg&#39;)&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    onmouseout=&#34;this.style.backgroundColor = &#39;color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-note) 10%, transparent)&#39;&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    role=&#34;alert&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    aria-labelledby=&#34;alert-0-title&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div&#xD;&#xA;      class=&#34; flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-6&#34;&#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;flex items-center gap-3&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        &lt;h4 id=&#34;alert-0-title&#34; class=&#34;text-foreground/90 m-0 font-semibold&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;          Note&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div&#xD;&#xA;      id=&#34;alert-0-content&#34;&#xD;&#xA;      class=&#34;alert-content  px-6 pb-6&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    &gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;prose prose-sm text-foreground/90 max-w-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#xD;&#xA;    href=&#34;https://code.visualstudio.com/api/ux-guidelines/overview&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  &gt;界面 UI&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt; 交互都是通过 &lt;a&#xD;&#xA;    href=&#34;https://code.visualstudio.com/api/references/contribution-points&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  &gt;contributes&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt; 进行配置&lt;/p&gt;</description>
